00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:13.620
Hey

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.280
S-Stop it!

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:17.740
...is that you feel way more agonizing

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:30.810
Looking at the stars

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:37.080
Traveling through the sky with the cold moon

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:41.410
Speak softly of

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:48.530
the unspeakable yearnings

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:52.170
Let the memories

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:58.830
gets frozen as poems in the long night

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:03.140
Let everything

00:13:03.140 --> 00:13:09.720
sunk faintly into silence

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:24.350
while still carry

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:30.600
the longing for the light

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:45.340
is hope

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:51.410
is metamorphosis
